<!-- 11. FAQ Accordion -->
<section id="faq" class="py-stack-lg bg-surface-container-low" style="background-color: var(--surface-container-low);">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile">
    <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-center mb-12">
      {{ section.settings.title | default: 'Frequently Asked Questions' }}
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-secondary-container" open style="border: 1px solid var(--secondary-container); background: #ffffff;">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-button text-button uppercase" style="cursor: pointer; padding: 24px;">
          How often should I apply the serum?
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="p-6 pt-0 font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary border-t border-secondary-container" style="padding: 24px; padding-top: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--secondary-container); color: var(--secondary);">
          For optimal results, apply the serum once daily, preferably in the evening after removing all eye makeup. A single stroke at the base of the upper lashes is sufficient.
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-secondary-container" style="border: 1px solid var(--secondary-container); background: #ffffff;">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-button text-button uppercase" style="cursor: pointer; padding: 24px;">
          Is it safe for contact lens wearers?
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="p-6 pt-0 font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary border-t border-secondary-container" style="padding: 24px; padding-top: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--secondary-container); color: var(--secondary);">
          Yes, our formula is ophthalmologist-tested and non-irritating. However, we recommend removing contact lenses before application and waiting 15 minutes before re-inserting them.
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-secondary-container" style="border: 1px solid var(--secondary-container); background: #ffffff;">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-button text-button uppercase" style="cursor: pointer; padding: 24px;">
          What happens if I stop using it?
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="p-6 pt-0 font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary border-t border-secondary-container" style="padding: 24px; padding-top: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--secondary-container); color: var(--secondary);">
          If you stop use, your lashes will eventually return to their natural growth cycle and previous appearance over the course of several weeks to months.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Accordion",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAQ Accordion"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
